#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:5 f918117715564c1088ee0dbe98c4cf61
msgid "Refining Calibration Parameters using a Flight Log"
msgstr "使用飞行日志优化校准参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:7 a63ad68415ab4a27aed5d192b1c54271
msgid ""
"The compass offsets, scales, diagonals, and even motor compensation can be "
"determined from a flight dataflash log of the vehicle using the web browser-"
"based WebTools MagFit utility. This utility is available `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/MAGFit/>`__."
msgstr ""
"罗盘的偏移量、比例、对角线，甚至电机补偿，均可通过飞行器的飞行数据闪存日志，使用基于浏览器的 WebTools MagFit 工具来确定。该工具可在 "
"`此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/MAGFit/>`__ 获取。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:9 658b05eabd4149c8abdc2875044ea028
msgid ""
"Using a flight log, the utility uses the GPS location, the vehicle attitude,"
" and the World Magnetic Model database to compare the logged magnetic field "
"components from the vehicle compass and compare the x/y/z values to that "
"expected which are graphed. It also will run a calibration routine to "
"correct the Ardupilot compass parameter values to improve the compass "
"performance. Offsets (OFS), diagonals(DIA), ellipticals(ODI), motor current "
"compensation, and scale parameters can be corrected."
msgstr ""
"利用飞行日志，该工具使用 GPS 位置、飞行器姿态和世界磁力模型数据库，将飞行器罗盘记录的磁场分量与预期值进行对比，并以图形展示 x/y/z "
"分量。它还会运行校准例程以修正 ArduPilot "
"罗盘参数值，提升罗盘性能。可修正的内容包括偏移量（OFS）、对角线（DIA）、椭圆形（ODI）、电机电流补偿及比例参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:12 c91651e539474935a41d4e877f629945
msgid "It can detect incorrect orientation, also."
msgstr "它还能检测方向设置是否有误。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:15 d187e072f509495c86b783c9cbb123be
msgid "Using WebTools MagFit"
msgstr "使用 WebTools MagFit"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:16 49636112133f49b3883b3a05e495170c
msgid "load flight log"
msgstr "加载飞行日志"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:17 c4439199ba994d8dba432e598614728c
msgid ""
"select relevant portion of log to analyze (eliminate on the ground portions)"
msgstr "选择要分析的日志相关部分（排除地面部分）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:18 8d52f9f766c74bef92c9d712136e6482
msgid ""
"select which parameters to optimize( unless there is significant motor "
"current interference or large nearby ferro-magnetic objects like batteries "
"to the compass, offset optimization  will usually be sufficient)"
msgstr "选择要优化的参数（除非存在显著的电机电流干扰或电池等大型铁磁体对罗盘的较强干扰，通常偏移量优化就足够了）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:19 da2f7bda2c3f4a8c844c8de478628e97
msgid ""
"check if the reduction in heading deviation is acceptable with the new param"
" values(usually <10deg is okay)"
msgstr "检查使用新参数值后航向偏差的减少是否可接受（通常 <10 度即可）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:20 451016bf16e044cd8d5df742898fa47b
msgid "save the new values to a file and load into the autopilot."
msgstr "将新值保存到文件并加载到飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:22 f82c5d8729fb4400a31354d48a15fcac
msgid "Here is a video explaining the utility's options and use:"
msgstr "以下视频介绍了该工具的选项和使用方法："

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:28 962fa8665e7a4f7abab490c05ab607b2
msgid "Using MAVExplorer's integrated Magfit utility"
msgstr "使用 MAVExplorer 集成的 Magfit 工具"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:30 1c29820177c647d2a00b8de3be9f08f2
msgid ""
"Now MAVExplorer has a Tools menu which includes this utility and allows it "
"to be applied to any portion of the log by simply opening any Graph and "
"zooming (magnifying glass icon) to the area to be analyzed. If no graph is "
"opened, and area selected, then the entire log will be used."
msgstr ""
"MAVExplorer "
"的工具菜单现已包含此工具，只需打开任意图表并缩放（放大镜图标）到要分析的区域即可应用。如果未打开图表也未选择区域，则使用整个日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:32 bcf66d4acc714c59a836523de1a71b28
msgid "Below is a video of the process."
msgstr "以下是操作过程的视频。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:34 37d1067bc81d455e84a84fb287cbaf93
msgid ""
"selecting CMOT No Change box, will calculate the CMOT correction values, but"
" not apply them to the corrected graph."
msgstr "勾选「CMOT No Change」框，将计算 CMOT 校正值，但不将其应用到修正后的图表中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:40 e64e6b935328484080b8b1b0692b874c
msgid "Hints and Tips"
msgstr "提示与技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:42 d8aa8808c98445c59b9ea80c05176dca
msgid ""
"Be sure you have several complete turns during the flight and at least a few"
" minutes of log."
msgstr "确保飞行过程中有数次完整圈和至少几分钟的日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:43 5eac401bb3de496d83d6581bb5b99029
msgid ""
"Be sure you put conditions on the analysis so you do not include data while "
"on the ground or being carried."
msgstr "确保为分析设置条件，不包含在地面或被携带时的数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:44 fa36279f65024b9ca82158cca4802cd3
msgid ""
"Be sure you have already calibrated the compasses prior to the flight. You "
"can use the tool on very poorly calibrated compasses, but that could be a "
"flight hazard (unless its a plane or vehicle not dependent on compass)."
msgstr "确保飞行前已校准罗盘。可以对校准极差的罗盘使用该工具，但这可能带来飞行风险（除非是不依赖罗盘的固定翼或其他飞行器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:45 6bf677de227f404ea3aa40ef364e1ebb
msgid ""
"If you have large COMPASS_MOT values indicating strong motor/battery system "
"interference, be sure that none of those components can shift in flight, "
"resulting in invalidating the compass motor interference corrections you "
"entered."
msgstr "如果 COMPASS_MOT 值较大，说明电机/电池系统干扰较强，须确保这些部件在飞行中不会移位，否则会使您输入的罗盘电机干扰补偿值失效。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:46 b6797d17c05940dd872897bea5886be3
msgid ""
"The EKF's sole purpose is to filter out sensor inaccuracies and system "
"disturbances. If the ATT yaw change is very large( > 20 degrees), this means"
" that something else is possibly very wrong in the other sensors, or vehicle"
" setup, and needs to be investigated before using the new compass "
"calibration parameter values."
msgstr ""
"EKF 的唯一目的是过滤传感器误差和系统扰动。如果 ATT 偏航变化非常大（>20 "
"度），说明其他传感器或飞行器设置可能存在严重问题，须在使用新罗盘校准参数值之前进行排查。"
